{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbedding","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbedding","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.RMatrixSl2","lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.PiTensorMonomialBasis","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.ToLin"],"declarations":57,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.heckeActionTensor_sigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.heckeActionTensor_sigma","kind":"theorem","line":776,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L776-L780","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.heckeActionTensor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.heckeActionTensor","kind":"def","line":761,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L761-L774","doc":"**The Hecke action on the genuine tensor power.** `H_{m+1}(q)` acting on\n`⨂[R] _ : Fin (m+1), (Fin 2 → R)` by `R`-linear endomorphisms, obtained from\n`heckeActionN` by reading matrices as linear maps and conjugating along `monoEquiv`.\n\nBoth steps are algebra *equivalences*, so nothing is lost: this is the same action, stated\nabout the object the corpus's other tensor-power results (`TensorPowerTrace`,\n`WeightedPermutationCharacter`) are stated about. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.heckeActionN_sigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.heckeActionN_sigma","kind":"theorem","line":750,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L750-L753","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.heckeActionN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.heckeActionN","kind":"def","line":702,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L702-L748","doc":"**The Hecke action.** `H_{m+1}(q) → End(V^{⊗(m+1)})`, sending the balanced generator\n`σ_a` to the braiding of strand `a`.\n\nAll three obligations are discharged by the general-`n` relations above: the quadratic by\n`isHeckeGenerator_braidAt`, the braid relation by `braidAt_braid`, far commutation by\n`braidAt_commute`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.strandBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.strandBraid","kind":"def","line":694,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L694-L697","doc":"The braiding of strand `a`: `Ř` acting at sites `a` and `a+1` of `V^{⊗(m+1)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.coxA_symm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.coxA_symm","kind":"theorem","line":684,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L684-L692","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.coxA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.coxA","kind":"def","line":679,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L679-L682","doc":"The type-`A` Coxeter matrix on `m` generators: adjacent strands braid (`3`), distant\nones commute (`2`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.braidAt_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.braidAt_braid","kind":"theorem","line":655,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L655-L666","doc":"**The braid relation at general `n`.** `Ř_{ij} Ř_{jk} Ř_{ij} = Ř_{jk} Ř_{ij} Ř_{jk}` for\nthree distinct sites — `yangBaxter` transported through the three-site embedding, with no\nnew matrix computation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_eq_embedTriple_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_eq_embedTriple_right","kind":"theorem","line":632,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L632-L653","doc":"`Ř` at sites `j, k` is `1 ⊗ Ř` at sites `i, j, k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_eq_embedTriple_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_eq_embedTriple_left","kind":"theorem","line":609,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L609-L630","doc":"`Ř` at sites `i, j` is `Ř ⊗ 1` at sites `i, j, k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedTriple_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedTriple_mul","kind":"theorem","line":592,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L592-L605","doc":"**The three-site embedding is multiplicative.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedTriple_update_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedTriple_update_apply","kind":"theorem","line":579,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L579-L590","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedTriple_apply_update","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedTriple_apply_update","kind":"theorem","line":571,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L571-L577","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.sum_collapse3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.sum_collapse3","kind":"theorem","line":538,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L538-L550","doc":"The three-site collapse: `2^n` terms become `8`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tripleEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tripleEquiv","kind":"def","line":509,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L509-L536","doc":"The three free sites parametrise the states agreeing with `a` elsewhere. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedTriple_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedTriple_apply","kind":"theorem","line":501,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L501-L505","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedTriple","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedTriple","kind":"def","line":493,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L493-L499","doc":"A three-site operator acting at `i`, `j`, `k` and trivially elsewhere. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.braidAt_commute","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.braidAt_commute","kind":"theorem","line":478,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L478-L482","doc":"**The braidings at disjoint site pairs commute** — far commutation for `Ř` itself. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_commute","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_commute","kind":"theorem","line":465,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L465-L476","doc":"**Far commutation.** Braidings at disjoint pairs of sites commute, at any `n`. This is\nthe defining relation `σ_i σ_j = σ_j σ_i` for `|i − j| ≥ 2`, in the site-indexed model. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.braidAt_sub_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.braidAt_sub_inv","kind":"theorem","line":401,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L401-L405","doc":"And satisfies the skein relation `Ř_{ij} − Ř_{ij}⁻¹ = q − qi`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.isUnit_braidAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.isUnit_braidAt","kind":"theorem","line":397,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L397-L399","doc":"Consequently the braiding at any two sites of `V^{⊗n}` is invertible. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.isHeckeGenerator_braidAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.isHeckeGenerator_braidAt","kind":"theorem","line":389,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L389-L395","doc":"**The general-`n` result.** At any number of tensor factors and any two distinct sites,\nthe embedded R-matrix is a §7a Hecke generator: `Ř_{ij}² = (q − qi) Ř_{ij} + 1`. So it is\ninvertible, satisfies the skein relation, and factors with eigenvalues `q` and `−qi` — all\ninherited through `embedPairHom` at no extra cost. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.braidAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.braidAt","kind":"def","line":385,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L385-L387","doc":"**The braiding at two sites of `V^{⊗n}`.** For any `n` and any two distinct sites. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPairHom_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPairHom_apply","kind":"theorem","line":381,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L381-L383","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPairHom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPairHom","kind":"def","line":370,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L370-L379","doc":"**`M ↦ M` at sites `i ≠ j` is an algebra map** `End(V ⊗ V) → End(V^{⊗n})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_algebraMap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_algebraMap","kind":"theorem","line":364,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L364-L368","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_smul","kind":"theorem","line":358,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L358-L362","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_add","kind":"theorem","line":354,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L354-L356","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_one","kind":"theorem","line":336,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L336-L352","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_mul","kind":"theorem","line":321,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L321-L334","doc":"**The site-indexed embedding is multiplicative.** The `2^n`-term sum collapses to the\nfour assignments to the two sites, which is exactly the matrix product on the window. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_update_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_update_apply","kind":"theorem","line":309,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L309-L319","doc":"The embedded operator's entry from such a state to an arbitrary `b`: the off-window\ncondition is unchanged by the update, so it is `a`'s own condition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_apply_update","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_apply_update","kind":"theorem","line":303,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L303-L307","doc":"The embedded operator's entry from `a` to a state differing only at the two sites. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.sum_collapse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.sum_collapse","kind":"theorem","line":273,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L273-L285","doc":"The collapse: a sum over all `2^n` states of a function supported on the states agreeing\nwith `a` off `{i, j}` is a sum over the four assignments to those two sites. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.pairEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.pairEquiv","kind":"def","line":248,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L248-L271","doc":"**The two free sites parametrise the states agreeing with `a` elsewhere.** Fixing a\nreference state `a`, the assignments to sites `i ≠ j` biject with the states that agree with\n`a` off `{i, j}`. This is the one combinatorial fact the site-indexed calculus needs; every\nsum below collapses along it from `2^n` terms to `4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair_apply","kind":"theorem","line":243,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L243-L246","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.embedPair","kind":"def","line":237,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L237-L241","doc":"A two-site operator acting at sites `i` and `j` of `V^{⊗n}` and trivially elsewhere. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.farCommute_rCheck","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.farCommute_rCheck","kind":"theorem","line":216,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L216-L221","doc":"The embedded braidings at *disjoint* pairs of sites commute — far commutation, obtained\nwith no computation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.yangBaxter_tensorId","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.yangBaxter_tensorId","kind":"theorem","line":206,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L206-L214","doc":"**Yang–Baxter survives the embedding.** The braid relation for the two embedded\nadjacent braidings, at any spectator size. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.isHeckeGenerator_tensorId_rCheck","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.isHeckeGenerator_tensorId_rCheck","kind":"theorem","line":198,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L198-L204","doc":"**The embedded braiding is still a §7a Hecke generator**, for a spectator factor of any\nsize. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId_commute_idTensor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId_commute_idTensor","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L183-L189","doc":"**Operators on disjoint factors commute.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensorHom_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensorHom_apply","kind":"theorem","line":174,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L174-L175","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorIdHom_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorIdHom_apply","kind":"theorem","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L171-L172","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensorHom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensorHom","kind":"def","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L162-L169","doc":"**`N ↦ 1 ⊗ N` is an algebra map.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorIdHom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorIdHom","kind":"def","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L152-L160","doc":"**`M ↦ M ⊗ 1` is an algebra map.** Everything in this file follows from this and its\nmirror image. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensor_algebraMap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensor_algebraMap","kind":"theorem","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L145-L150","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId_algebraMap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId_algebraMap","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L138-L143","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensor_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensor_add","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L134-L136","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId_add","kind":"theorem","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L130-L132","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensor_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensor_one","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L125-L128","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId_one","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L120-L123","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensor_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensor_mul","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L114-L118","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId_mul","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L107-L112","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensor_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensor_apply","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L104-L105","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId_apply","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L101-L102","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.idTensor","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L97-L99","doc":"`1 ⊗ N`: act by `N` on the `ρ`-factor, do nothing to the `σ`-factor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.tensorId","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L93-L95","doc":"`M ⊗ 1`: act by `M` on the `σ`-factor, do nothing to the `ρ`-factor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.IsHeckeGenerator.map","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbed.IsHeckeGenerator.map","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorEmbedding.lean#L74-L82","doc":"**`IsHeckeGenerator` is preserved by every algebra map.** The §7a quadratic is an\nequation between products and scalars, so any `R`-algebra map carries it along. This is\nwhat makes the embeddings below cost nothing. ","signatureChunk":0}]}